# 📖 Revision Cheat Sheet

| Concept               | Key Point                                                   |
| --------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
| CSRF                  | Tricks authenticated users into sending unintended requests |
| Anti-CSRF Token       | Verifies legitimate form submissions                        |
| SameSite              | Controls when cookies are sent in cross-site requests       |
| Secure Cookie         | Sent only over HTTPS                                        |
| HttpOnly              | Prevents direct JavaScript access to cookies                |
| Session Fixation      | Prevent by regenerating session IDs after login             |
| Session Timeout       | Limits risk from inactive sessions                          |
| Clickjacking          | Tricks users into clicking hidden elements                  |
| X-Frame-Options       | Helps prevent unauthorized framing                          |
| CSP `frame-ancestors` | Modern framing protection                                   |

